WEBVTT

02:59.120 --> 03:03.960
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WORK
"LOVER" BY SHE MU SI

03:34.120 --> 03:35.400
Surprised?

03:37.280 --> 03:38.680
When did you come back?

03:40.120 --> 03:41.000
At dawn.

03:42.040 --> 03:43.840
Why didn't you wake me up?

03:44.840 --> 03:46.480
Why would I?

03:59.600 --> 04:01.200
What would you like for breakfast?

04:01.280 --> 04:02.200
I'll rustle it up.

04:03.600 --> 04:04.760
Let's see.

04:04.840 --> 04:07.040
Is there anything
that Queen Mother can't cook up?

04:07.520 --> 04:08.600
Easy there, Your Highness.

04:09.560 --> 04:11.760
I am not the royal chef.

04:15.320 --> 04:16.320
You have a call.

04:23.360 --> 04:25.000
Hello. Niaoniao.

04:25.080 --> 04:27.160
Jie, code black. Come home, quick.

04:27.760 --> 04:28.920
What's the matter?

04:29.000 --> 04:31.520
Mom is lashing out at Yan
because you've been out all night.

04:31.600 --> 04:32.480
I'm next.

04:32.560 --> 04:34.680
Hurry home. This is your fault.

04:36.600 --> 04:39.360
You're an adult. Why do you have a curfew?

04:39.440 --> 04:41.640
It's all thanks to you.

04:43.080 --> 04:44.040
Shoot.

04:45.400 --> 04:46.640
Never mind. It's Wang Xixia.

04:47.480 --> 04:48.320
Hello.

04:50.160 --> 04:52.720
Are you back? Perfect.

04:52.800 --> 04:55.080
Hold up. Listen to me.

04:55.160 --> 04:56.800
Hold your horses.

04:56.880 --> 04:59.320
I need you to go to my house
and soothe my mom.

05:00.720 --> 05:01.880
No.

05:04.200 --> 05:05.360
I was out all night.

05:11.600 --> 05:12.960
I can't talk about it right now.

05:14.240 --> 05:15.960
I'll tell you later.

05:16.720 --> 05:18.520
Hurry. Bye.

05:21.280 --> 05:23.280
It sounds like breakfast
is out of the question.

05:25.760 --> 05:26.960
I'll give you a ride home.

05:49.160 --> 05:50.400
What?

05:53.440 --> 05:54.280
Allow me.

05:56.120 --> 05:57.280
It's okay.

06:35.160 --> 06:36.360
It is kind of ugly.

07:04.680 --> 07:06.520
Thankfully, I looked it up online.

07:07.680 --> 07:09.120
I would have never figured it out.

07:15.800 --> 07:16.720
But don't worry.

07:18.240 --> 07:19.680
I'll get better at this.

07:39.560 --> 07:41.040
Compared to my day job,

07:42.000 --> 07:43.600
this is a breeze.

08:19.200 --> 08:20.360
LIAOGEN CHICKEN

08:23.640 --> 08:24.480
See you.

08:26.360 --> 08:27.240
Bye.

08:29.880 --> 08:32.080
Bunch of heartless kids, all of you.

08:32.159 --> 08:33.799
How can I cheer up?

08:33.880 --> 08:35.320
I'm not in the mood to work today.

08:35.400 --> 08:37.640
Listen, don't try to console me.

08:37.720 --> 08:39.440
You don't know
what it's like to be a parent.

08:39.520 --> 08:40.720
Godmother, calm down.

08:40.799 --> 08:42.440
We're talking business here.

08:44.080 --> 08:44.960
Zhuang Yan,

08:46.000 --> 08:46.960
shoulders back.

08:47.040 --> 08:49.120
How can you run a business
with a gloomy face?

08:50.080 --> 08:50.920
Niaoniao, smile.

08:52.440 --> 08:53.800
Niaoniao, smile.

08:56.360 --> 08:57.560
And you, Godmother.

08:57.640 --> 08:59.880
How can you bring emotions
into the workplace?

08:59.960 --> 09:01.200
I just sell chickens.

09:01.280 --> 09:02.960
Why should I manage my emotions?

09:03.040 --> 09:04.120
Of course you should.

09:04.840 --> 09:07.160
Aren't you a career woman like us?

09:08.120 --> 09:09.880
How can you
let your standards drop? Right?

09:09.960 --> 09:11.160
Look around you.

09:11.240 --> 09:12.480
Except for you three,

09:12.560 --> 09:14.200
everyone is smiling.

09:14.280 --> 09:15.800
I don't feel like smiling today.

09:15.880 --> 09:17.720
How can you run a business like that?

09:18.960 --> 09:21.800
Wang Xixia, you're back!

09:27.080 --> 09:29.400
What's going on? Why so serious?

09:30.920 --> 09:32.080
Did you hear that?

09:32.160 --> 09:33.880
This is how a businesswoman should be.

09:34.360 --> 09:36.800
You can't argue with a smile, right?

09:36.880 --> 09:37.840
Right.

09:37.920 --> 09:39.440
See? It's not just me.

09:39.520 --> 09:41.960
Is it not?
You've been blabbering all morning.

09:42.040 --> 09:43.480
And we haven't done any work.

09:43.560 --> 09:44.480
Never mind.

09:44.560 --> 09:46.560
Xixia, are you having dinner with us?

09:47.520 --> 09:48.600
I'll buy a fish.

09:59.400 --> 10:00.640
Chen Maidong?

10:01.360 --> 10:04.360
See? Even Chen Maidong is in good spirits.

10:04.440 --> 10:07.280
It's a joyous season. Isn't it, Godmother?

10:08.160 --> 10:09.120
Come on, smile.

10:11.320 --> 10:12.200
Shoo!

10:12.280 --> 10:13.840
LIAOGEN BRAISED CHICKEN

10:17.840 --> 10:18.920
Jie.

10:19.000 --> 10:20.560
Say no more. Red packets.

10:20.640 --> 10:22.240
I'll give you each a big red packet.

10:22.320 --> 10:24.200
That's hardly enough
to heal my emotional trauma.

10:24.280 --> 10:25.800
What a morning.

10:25.880 --> 10:28.480
I'm so glad you're back.
Let's do some Lunar New Year shopping.

10:30.880 --> 10:32.560
Are you not
spending Lunar New Year with us?

10:34.320 --> 10:35.760
I'm spending it with Cui Ge.

10:35.840 --> 10:38.240
After the fifth,
we're going to his sister's house

10:38.320 --> 10:39.440
to visit his mom.

10:39.520 --> 10:41.520
Wang Xixia, congratulations.

10:43.360 --> 10:44.560
Congratulate yourself.

10:44.640 --> 10:45.840
You set us up.

10:46.600 --> 10:49.080
Cui Ge has been asking me
to send his gratitude.

10:49.720 --> 10:50.640
He is most welcome.

10:51.600 --> 10:53.400
I thought so. He can thank you himself.

10:53.480 --> 10:56.800
Don't skimp on the cash gift, okay?

10:56.880 --> 10:59.320
Sure. It's no big deal.

11:00.960 --> 11:01.840
But…

11:04.480 --> 11:05.640
Are you going to settle down?

11:14.440 --> 11:15.560
You know me.

11:15.640 --> 11:18.360
I'm not picky, unlike you.

11:18.440 --> 11:21.320
Come on. You know
none of the previous guys were any good.

11:26.000 --> 11:27.400
Is Cui Ge really a good guy?

11:31.840 --> 11:34.680
I can't say what the future holds.

11:34.760 --> 11:36.440
I'll just take it one step at a time.

11:36.520 --> 11:39.280
But at least,

11:39.360 --> 11:40.800
for the first time ever,

11:41.320 --> 11:43.760
I am no longer afraid.

11:47.480 --> 11:50.280
Wang Xixia, you've found your family.

11:51.800 --> 11:52.960
I'm so happy for you.

11:58.680 --> 12:00.160
Don't tease me.

12:02.120 --> 12:03.640
So Ms. Nightwalker,

12:03.720 --> 12:05.280
what's going on between you two?

12:08.800 --> 12:09.880
We are…

12:11.280 --> 12:13.160
really close.

12:14.320 --> 12:15.440
What's with that expression?

12:19.920 --> 12:22.920
Maintaining a relationship
takes more than just hormones.

12:23.000 --> 12:24.480
You also need money

12:24.560 --> 12:26.000
and a house.

12:27.120 --> 12:28.080
I know.

12:28.160 --> 12:30.000
That's why we're busting our necks
in Shanghai.

12:31.680 --> 12:33.360
We're no longer young but not yet old.

12:33.440 --> 12:35.240
We're no longer poor
but not yet successful.

12:35.320 --> 12:37.200
To get ahead in life, we need a miracle.

12:37.280 --> 12:39.400
Yet we're too stubborn to quit.

12:39.480 --> 12:41.280
I've been feeling anxious.

12:42.280 --> 12:43.960
I work from 9 a.m. to 5 p.m. every day.

12:44.040 --> 12:46.520
Even when I'm 40, nothing will change.

12:46.600 --> 12:48.240
Even if Chen Maidong loves me,

12:48.320 --> 12:49.320
it would be too late.

12:49.920 --> 12:52.240
The only solution is
to become an entrepreneur.

12:54.200 --> 12:55.120
You're right.

12:55.600 --> 12:56.840
Forget about financial freedom.

12:56.920 --> 12:58.240
Personal freedom comes first.

12:59.000 --> 13:00.680
Even though I live in Nanping,

13:00.760 --> 13:02.720
I haven't lost my savvy.

13:02.800 --> 13:04.840
I've been talking to Ms. Huang.

13:05.680 --> 13:06.720
Our former boss?

13:08.360 --> 13:11.040
I've always admired her career foresight.

13:11.600 --> 13:15.240
I heard she's working
on a medical data integration platform.

13:15.320 --> 13:17.880
Perhaps she might need us in the future.

13:19.920 --> 13:21.400
That's wonderful.

13:22.080 --> 13:23.560
You pave the way.

13:23.640 --> 13:25.640
When the opportunity comes,
we'll seize it together.

13:39.960 --> 13:41.800
Lin, look.

13:43.400 --> 13:44.560
That's not all.

13:45.840 --> 13:48.160
Well? Aren't I lucky?

13:48.240 --> 13:49.160
This year,

13:49.240 --> 13:50.920
I don't even need to lift a finger

13:51.000 --> 13:53.120
for spring cleaning.

13:53.200 --> 13:55.880
Jie is such a meticulous cleaner

13:55.960 --> 13:57.400
compared to Maidong.

13:57.480 --> 13:58.400
Look.

13:59.040 --> 14:01.960
The house is clean and bright.

14:02.640 --> 14:04.840
Even a fly would slip off the walls!

14:05.320 --> 14:06.400
Ms. Lin.

14:09.440 --> 14:10.600
Ms. Lin,

14:10.680 --> 14:11.920
I heard you're feeling better.

14:12.000 --> 14:13.640
How about spending Lunar New Year with us?

14:13.720 --> 14:14.600
I'll pick you up.

14:14.680 --> 14:16.280
Thank you, Jie.

14:16.360 --> 14:18.680
My appetite has recovered.

14:19.320 --> 14:20.760
But I look terrible.

14:20.840 --> 14:22.200
It's embarrassing.

14:23.040 --> 14:24.200
Maybe another time.

14:26.440 --> 14:28.520
You've been to hell and back,

14:28.600 --> 14:30.800
and you're worried about your looks?

14:31.280 --> 14:33.400
Come on. Let me see you.

14:33.480 --> 14:34.520
No one is going to mind.

14:35.200 --> 14:37.320
But I do mind, okay?

14:39.520 --> 14:40.360
All right.

14:41.040 --> 14:43.160
Time to go home. I'll take it from here.

14:43.240 --> 14:44.800
What's the hurry?

14:44.880 --> 14:47.280
My family isn't exactly short-handed.

14:47.360 --> 14:48.760
You've been standing for ages.

14:48.840 --> 14:49.920
Come on, get down.

14:57.320 --> 14:58.320
There they go again.

14:58.400 --> 15:01.080
They're mushy every day.

15:01.800 --> 15:05.760
The Internet calls it
"a public display of affection".

15:06.840 --> 15:08.040
Mrs. Chen, we're off.

15:09.720 --> 15:12.520
Okay. Get some rest.

15:12.600 --> 15:15.320
I'm going to share some jokes
with Ms. Lin.

15:15.920 --> 15:17.560
Ms. Lin, see you.

15:17.640 --> 15:19.640
Ms. Lin, Happy Lunar New Year!

15:20.960 --> 15:21.880
Let's go.

15:25.120 --> 15:26.040
Let's see.

15:26.120 --> 15:29.400
You're going to love these jokes.

15:33.160 --> 15:36.640
"An old woman said she hoped one day…"

15:39.920 --> 15:41.760
Come on. I'll give you a ride.

15:43.080 --> 15:44.920
-What about these two?
-Take them home.

15:45.000 --> 15:45.840
Sure.

15:48.360 --> 15:49.240
Chen Maidong,

15:50.280 --> 15:51.480
Happy Lunar New Year.

15:53.800 --> 15:54.800
Same to you.

15:55.360 --> 15:56.240
Happy Lunar New Year.

16:02.760 --> 16:03.600
Let's go!

16:12.920 --> 16:14.600
I don't want to let you go.

16:16.680 --> 16:19.240
Let's never be apart, Chen Maidong.

16:21.560 --> 16:23.000
Cut it out. I need to go.

16:23.080 --> 16:25.160
No. Stay a little longer.

16:25.240 --> 16:26.200
Cut it out.

16:26.680 --> 16:28.280
Your mom might see us.

16:28.360 --> 16:30.640
Wait. You haven't kissed me today.

16:30.720 --> 16:32.720
Are you a fish?
Do you have a seven-second memory?

16:32.800 --> 16:34.440
Yes, I'm a fish. Will you kiss me?

16:37.880 --> 16:38.720
This side.

16:43.200 --> 16:45.040
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven.

16:45.120 --> 16:46.760
That's seven seconds. Once more.

16:46.840 --> 16:48.800
You're so greedy. Get off.

16:51.000 --> 16:51.920
Stop it.

16:52.000 --> 16:53.400
Your mom already hates me.

16:53.480 --> 16:54.880
Mom doesn't hate you anymore.

16:54.960 --> 16:56.880
Why don't you come in?

16:56.960 --> 16:57.920
I'm not suicidal.

16:58.000 --> 16:59.640
Just the thought of her makes me scared.

16:59.720 --> 17:01.440
If I see her, I'm going to stutter.

17:02.200 --> 17:04.040
You have to meet
your mother-in-law eventually.

17:04.119 --> 17:06.000
I'm not mentally prepared.

17:06.079 --> 17:07.200
I can't stand it anymore.

17:08.359 --> 17:10.480
Why don't you lovebirds come in?

17:13.040 --> 17:15.480
No, thanks, Zhuang Yan. I'll pass.

17:15.560 --> 17:17.040
Is Mom not in?

17:17.119 --> 17:19.000
She went to see Madam Wu
and isn't back yet.

17:20.040 --> 17:22.079
Maidong, would you like to come in?

17:22.160 --> 17:24.280
Please come in!

17:24.359 --> 17:26.240
Just for a while!

17:27.000 --> 17:28.600
For a while.

17:31.360 --> 17:32.280
Have a seat.

18:10.720 --> 18:12.040
There's so much to be done here.

18:12.120 --> 18:13.400
Why did you come to my house?

18:13.480 --> 18:14.360
Because I wanted to.

18:15.440 --> 18:16.640
Are you having an attitude?

18:21.400 --> 18:22.280
Niaoniao.

18:23.040 --> 18:24.280
Are there any chores left?

18:24.360 --> 18:25.320
You can put me to work.

18:27.800 --> 18:30.520
Maidong, I have my principles.

18:30.600 --> 18:32.000
Are you my brother-in-law?

18:32.080 --> 18:33.760
If not, I can't order you around.

18:35.080 --> 18:36.040
Well…

18:36.600 --> 18:37.880
It's a bit early to tell.

18:37.960 --> 18:39.120
Then what's your relationship?

18:40.040 --> 18:41.120
-We're--
-Lovers.

18:41.920 --> 18:43.440
Don't say that to a child.

18:43.520 --> 18:44.720
How would you define it, then?

18:44.800 --> 18:46.680
High school classmates? Soulmates?

18:46.760 --> 18:48.360
Lovers? Sweethearts?

18:48.440 --> 18:50.640
Maidong, I have a favor to ask you.

18:52.440 --> 18:53.720
Are you good at calligraphy?

19:03.720 --> 19:05.200
It's not festive enough.

19:05.280 --> 19:06.200
You're one to talk.

19:06.280 --> 19:07.520
This phrase doesn't make sense.

19:15.280 --> 19:16.880
How about this?

19:16.960 --> 19:18.920
"May food fortune await you outside."

19:19.000 --> 19:20.840
"May peace embrace you at home."

19:20.920 --> 19:21.760
How about this?

19:21.840 --> 19:23.480
"When conditions align, a path will open."

19:23.560 --> 19:25.600
"Bestowing prosperity
on the nation and the people."

19:25.680 --> 19:27.600
Jie, are you copying everything
from the Internet?

19:27.680 --> 19:29.560
Dad was an original content creator.

19:29.640 --> 19:31.040
Every generation is getting worse.

19:31.120 --> 19:32.360
Who has the time to be original?

19:32.440 --> 19:34.360
What about the horizontal banner?

19:35.400 --> 19:37.120
There are no examples on this website.

19:37.200 --> 19:39.280
He Niaoniao, you're almost in high school.

19:39.360 --> 19:41.080
Can't you create a horizontal banner?

19:43.600 --> 19:45.160
All my friends have a banner that says,

19:45.240 --> 19:46.400
"Five blessings be upon us."

19:46.480 --> 19:47.360
Let's go with that.

19:47.440 --> 19:48.920
Can you be more original?

19:49.000 --> 19:50.600
I want it to be, "Excel at your studies."

19:50.680 --> 19:52.640
-But that's a lot of pressure.
-Please.

19:52.720 --> 19:53.560
Make up your mind.

19:54.360 --> 19:55.600
I've written so many banners.

19:55.680 --> 19:56.840
I'm getting tired.

20:14.280 --> 20:15.320
It's okay.

20:34.400 --> 20:37.080
That pot has already been scrubbed.

20:37.160 --> 20:38.720
Stop or the coating will peel off.

20:38.800 --> 20:39.960
Why do you care?

20:41.160 --> 20:44.360
Why didn't you tell me
before bringing him home?

20:45.000 --> 20:46.560
I didn't plan for it to happen.

20:46.640 --> 20:47.840
He happened to drop by.

20:47.920 --> 20:49.800
Maidong, write the banner.

20:49.880 --> 20:50.840
Okay.

20:50.920 --> 20:52.400
You may as well say hi.

20:52.480 --> 20:53.760
I'm not mentally prepared.

20:54.240 --> 20:56.120
Prepared? For what?

20:56.200 --> 20:58.320
It's scary for a guy
to meet the mother-in-law.

20:58.400 --> 20:59.560
But why are you scared?

21:00.520 --> 21:01.600
Do you have no shame?

21:01.680 --> 21:04.080
Mother-in-law? You two aren't there yet.

21:04.160 --> 21:05.000
Okay.

21:05.080 --> 21:07.040
Then think of him as my friend.

21:07.720 --> 21:08.920
Go and say hi.

21:09.000 --> 21:09.880
I will not.

21:10.600 --> 21:12.560
If you were dating with marriage in mind,

21:12.640 --> 21:14.480
I would be all for it.

21:14.560 --> 21:15.800
But you?

21:15.880 --> 21:16.920
You left things ambiguous.

21:17.000 --> 21:18.400
You took off after the New Year,

21:18.480 --> 21:20.720
leaving me and him
in an awkward situation.

21:20.800 --> 21:22.480
I would rather pretend
not to know him now.

21:22.560 --> 21:24.040
You worry too much.

21:24.680 --> 21:26.560
You worry too little.

21:27.560 --> 21:30.240
If you hurt him, he will hate me too.

21:31.120 --> 21:32.240
Ms. Liao.

21:33.640 --> 21:36.280
I'm sorry for dropping by
without giving you notice.

21:36.360 --> 21:37.240
I'll leave at once.

21:37.320 --> 21:38.160
No!

21:38.240 --> 21:40.560
Leave? Silly child.

21:40.640 --> 21:43.320
I was just about to serve you some fruit.

21:43.400 --> 21:44.880
You're our first-time guest,

21:44.960 --> 21:46.480
and we didn't even feed you.

21:47.120 --> 21:48.760
Jie is so thoughtless.

21:48.840 --> 21:50.080
She didn't plan anything.

21:50.640 --> 21:51.680
It's my fault.

21:51.760 --> 21:53.640
I dropped by so suddenly
and even empty-handed.

21:53.720 --> 21:54.760
Please forgive me.

21:54.840 --> 21:56.800
Not at all.

21:56.880 --> 21:58.600
Please, make yourself at home.

21:58.680 --> 22:01.000
The children are delighted to see you.

22:01.080 --> 22:02.880
Come on in. Let's chit-chat.

22:03.400 --> 22:04.440
Sure.

22:04.520 --> 22:05.960
You always seemed so busy.

22:06.040 --> 22:07.280
I did not want to bother you.

22:07.360 --> 22:09.000
Busy? Heavens, no!

22:09.080 --> 22:09.960
Please, have a seat.

22:10.040 --> 22:12.160
You youngsters are the ones
doing the important work.

22:13.560 --> 22:14.600
Sit. Have some fruit.

22:14.680 --> 22:15.560
Allow me.

22:16.040 --> 22:17.160
Have a seat.

22:18.480 --> 22:20.160
How is your grandma?

22:20.240 --> 22:22.480
It was quite an incident that time.

22:22.560 --> 22:24.080
I was worried for days.

22:24.160 --> 22:25.120
Thanks for your concern.

22:25.640 --> 22:26.600
My grandma is fine.

22:26.680 --> 22:28.760
She has a strong constitution
and exercises frequently.

22:28.840 --> 22:30.000
Good.

22:30.760 --> 22:31.800
Even a busy man like you

22:31.880 --> 22:33.480
should not forget to exercise.

22:33.560 --> 22:34.840
Yes.

22:34.920 --> 22:38.800
I never realized
how incredibly tall you are.

22:38.880 --> 22:40.400
Yes. I take after my grandpa.

22:40.480 --> 22:41.520
He was 1.85 m tall.

22:42.080 --> 22:43.440
Good.

22:43.520 --> 22:44.720
Good genes, I see.

22:45.320 --> 22:46.600
Your family has better genes.

22:47.320 --> 22:49.240
Your children owe it all to you.

22:50.640 --> 22:51.960
Those three rascals?

22:52.760 --> 22:54.720
-Please, have some fruit.
-Thanks.

22:54.800 --> 22:57.320
Maidong, sorry for today.

22:57.400 --> 22:59.600
Come again on the second
for Jie's birthday.

22:59.680 --> 23:00.800
I'll prepare a nice meal.

23:04.720 --> 23:05.880
USHER IN WEALTH AND PROSPERITY

23:12.120 --> 23:14.800
LIAOGEN CHICKEN, A TIME-HONORED BRAND

23:14.880 --> 23:17.000
MAY ALL YOUR WISHES COME TRUE

23:17.080 --> 23:19.200
MAY LUCKY STARS SHINE ON YOU
FIVE BLESSINGS BE UPON US

23:19.280 --> 23:21.360
Check out all these features.

23:21.440 --> 23:24.400
Hot compress, massage, and reverse.

23:24.480 --> 23:26.960
It can even give you a foot massage.

23:27.040 --> 23:28.840
Everything is so high-tech nowadays.

23:32.760 --> 23:34.280
Look at that.

23:36.120 --> 23:39.000
I've never received
such a thoughtful gift.

23:40.040 --> 23:41.440
Maidong, thank you so much.

23:42.520 --> 23:43.360
Don't mention it.

23:46.600 --> 23:49.280
This is so much better
than all those miscellaneous bottles

23:49.360 --> 23:51.120
without Chinese instructions
that you give me.

23:52.200 --> 23:53.480
How could you?

23:53.560 --> 23:54.600
Are you neglecting us

23:54.680 --> 23:56.000
now that you have Maidong?

23:56.560 --> 23:58.000
How unappreciative.

23:58.080 --> 24:00.080
Yan, this year is going to be different.

24:00.680 --> 24:02.880
This year, all of us,
including our two dads,

24:02.960 --> 24:04.600
are going to have a blast.

24:05.280 --> 24:06.440
Indeed.

24:06.520 --> 24:08.680
Maidong is our lucky star.

24:10.280 --> 24:11.440
You said it.

24:18.960 --> 24:21.320
-Happy Lunar New Year!
-Happy Lunar New Year!

24:21.400 --> 24:22.800
And happy birthday to Jie.

24:22.880 --> 24:24.320
-Happy birthday.
-Happy birthday.

24:26.040 --> 24:28.760
I'm going to drink
to my heart's content. Don't stop me.

24:28.840 --> 24:30.800
Go for it. I've got you covered.

24:32.400 --> 24:33.840
Maidong's shrimp is amazing.

24:34.520 --> 24:36.000
His fish isn't bad either.

24:36.080 --> 24:37.720
It's even better than Xixia's.

24:38.520 --> 24:40.080
I knew you had an agenda.

24:40.160 --> 24:41.240
I did not underestimate you.

24:41.320 --> 24:43.160
At this rate, you'll replace me.

24:43.640 --> 24:44.880
It's a fair competition.

24:46.760 --> 24:48.240
Life is kind to me.

24:48.880 --> 24:50.600
Although I lost someone,

24:50.680 --> 24:52.000
I gained a "son."

24:52.080 --> 24:53.880
My life is now complete.

24:55.080 --> 24:55.920
Ms. Liao.

24:57.200 --> 24:59.160
Jie, I want to eat cake.

24:59.240 --> 25:00.560
Hurry up and blow out the candle.

25:01.360 --> 25:02.840
But we haven't finished dinner.

25:02.920 --> 25:04.040
Are you serious?

25:04.120 --> 25:05.440
Please.

25:05.520 --> 25:06.760
All right.

25:12.280 --> 25:13.160
There you go.

25:13.240 --> 25:16.520
-Happy birthday to you
-Happy birthday to you

25:16.600 --> 25:19.360
-Happy birthday to you
-Happy birthday to you

25:19.440 --> 25:22.720
-Happy birthday to you
-Happy birthday to you

25:22.800 --> 25:25.840
-Happy birthday to you
-Happy birthday to you

25:25.920 --> 25:26.800
Make a wish.

25:30.000 --> 25:31.240
I wish

25:31.960 --> 25:33.200
my family

25:36.920 --> 25:37.760
and my darling

25:39.360 --> 25:42.160
happiness and success.

25:44.040 --> 25:47.440
May this year bring new surprises

25:47.520 --> 25:48.760
and prosperity to the country.

25:51.680 --> 25:53.720
What a generous wish.

25:55.480 --> 25:56.360
Wait a minute, Jie.

25:57.160 --> 25:58.600
You told me Maidong was your lover.

25:58.680 --> 25:59.880
Why is he your darling now?

25:59.960 --> 26:01.240
Little brat.

26:01.320 --> 26:02.800
Stop talking nonsense.

26:02.880 --> 26:04.080
Eat your cake.

26:11.840 --> 26:12.880
You're such a glutton.

26:12.960 --> 26:13.880
Exactly.

26:16.120 --> 26:17.080
Yes?

26:24.360 --> 26:26.320
Okay, got it.

26:27.800 --> 26:28.640
What's the matter?

26:28.720 --> 26:30.440
Sorry, guys. I have to go.

26:31.520 --> 26:34.080
Maidong, you've hardly touched your food.

26:35.520 --> 26:37.120
Is something wrong?

26:39.640 --> 26:42.000
It's a work emergency. I need to go.

26:42.720 --> 26:43.880
Go right ahead.

26:43.960 --> 26:45.480
No worries. We understand.

26:46.560 --> 26:47.680
Thanks, Ms. Liao.

26:47.760 --> 26:49.240
Enjoy your meal. Don't worry about me.

26:49.320 --> 26:50.200
Go on.

27:10.800 --> 27:11.760
Last night,

27:11.840 --> 27:14.240
Grandma's layer hen went missing.

27:14.320 --> 27:16.600
Do you think it was stolen?

27:17.160 --> 27:19.120
Who has the appetite for your chicken?

27:19.200 --> 27:20.120
Seriously.

27:20.200 --> 27:22.320
We just have two meals left.

27:22.400 --> 27:24.440
Even mahjong is getting boring.

27:25.000 --> 27:26.520
I hope the holidays end soon.

27:26.600 --> 27:27.960
Celebrating Lunar New Year

27:28.040 --> 27:29.560
is so tiring.

27:29.640 --> 27:32.000
We're the only ones who feel tired.

27:32.800 --> 27:33.800
Look at them.

27:33.880 --> 27:35.320
Those loafers.

27:35.400 --> 27:36.680
They make me so angry.

27:36.760 --> 27:39.280
They always whine and never help out.

27:39.360 --> 27:40.360
You said it.

27:40.440 --> 27:43.480
Whenever I look at Sun,
I feel like kicking him.

27:44.560 --> 27:45.640
If you ask me,

27:45.720 --> 27:47.680
we should kick all the men out.

27:47.760 --> 27:48.720
Meanwhile,

27:48.800 --> 27:50.400
Ms. Liao's son-in-law is hard at work.

27:50.480 --> 27:52.280
-Yes.
-Don't remind me.

27:52.360 --> 27:55.200
Maidong didn't even get
to enjoy his Lunar New Year dinner.

27:55.280 --> 27:57.000
I feel bad for him.

27:57.080 --> 27:58.360
That's true.

27:59.000 --> 28:00.440
By the way, have you heard?

28:00.960 --> 28:03.520
The funeral parlor is swamped.

28:03.600 --> 28:05.080
The provincial highway accident

28:05.160 --> 28:06.880
still hasn't been cleared yet.

28:06.960 --> 28:08.080
Ms. Zhao,

28:08.160 --> 28:09.480
was it serious?

28:09.560 --> 28:10.800
I heard on the radio

28:10.880 --> 28:13.080
we're supposed to avoid the area,
so I haven't gone there.

28:13.720 --> 28:14.680
Jie,

28:14.760 --> 28:15.720
you have no idea.

28:15.800 --> 28:17.000
It's a total disaster.

28:17.080 --> 28:19.480
Li came back from the scene this morning.

28:19.560 --> 28:20.760
He was too shocked to even eat.

28:20.840 --> 28:24.400
Mr. Xu from Shangxi Village
had just passed away.

28:24.480 --> 28:25.480
His rich son

28:25.560 --> 28:26.720
spent a fortune

28:26.800 --> 28:27.840
to hold a big funeral.

28:27.920 --> 28:29.680
It went on for days.

28:29.760 --> 28:32.080
On the final night of the funeral,

28:32.160 --> 28:34.640
on their way to the funeral parlor,

28:34.720 --> 28:36.920
a truck came charging out of nowhere

28:37.000 --> 28:40.000
and crashed into the procession.

28:40.080 --> 28:41.320
Can you imagine?

28:41.400 --> 28:43.640
There were dozens of people.

28:43.720 --> 28:45.760
Seven or eight people died on the spot.

28:45.840 --> 28:46.720
Really?

28:46.800 --> 28:48.280
Are you sure Li didn't exaggerate?

28:48.360 --> 28:49.600
Of course not.

28:49.680 --> 28:52.600
This must be the biggest tragedy
that has ever happened in this town.

28:52.680 --> 28:54.520
Right? It's so scary.

28:54.600 --> 28:55.640
I'm going to check it out.

28:55.720 --> 28:56.960
Jie, I'll go.

28:57.040 --> 28:59.360
Maidong could use my help.

28:59.440 --> 29:01.600
Zhuang Jie, let him go instead.

29:05.880 --> 29:07.080
And on Lunar New Year's Day!

29:07.160 --> 29:09.200
TUNNEL CLOSED

29:09.280 --> 29:11.720
ROAD CLOSURE NOTICE

29:12.320 --> 29:13.760
NO ENTRY, ROAD CLOSED

29:14.400 --> 29:19.240
ROAD CLOSED

29:19.320 --> 29:23.360
TUNNEL CLOSED, DETOUR

29:39.440 --> 29:40.280
Maidong!

29:44.560 --> 29:45.520
Hold up, Hai.

29:48.120 --> 29:50.240
Zhuang Yan, what brings you here?

29:50.320 --> 29:52.200
Maidong, we're worried about you.

29:54.880 --> 29:56.240
Do you need any help?

29:59.960 --> 30:01.160
We're almost done.

30:01.240 --> 30:02.400
I have my colleagues.

30:03.120 --> 30:04.720
Don't worry. Go home.

30:05.440 --> 30:07.960
Maidong, just give me a task.

30:08.040 --> 30:09.240
I have nothing to do anyway.

30:11.720 --> 30:12.640
Okay.

30:13.400 --> 30:15.360
If we need help cleaning up,

30:15.440 --> 30:16.480
I'll let you know.

30:18.640 --> 30:19.520
Go home.

30:23.840 --> 30:24.720
Let's go.

30:39.480 --> 30:42.040
NANPING FUNERAL PARLOR

32:43.360 --> 32:47.200
BEING MORTAL,
WE CAN ONLY LESSEN OUR GRIEF

32:47.280 --> 32:53.760
BEING MORTAL,
WE CAN ONLY LESSEN OUR GRIEF

33:14.160 --> 33:15.040
Who is it?

33:17.760 --> 33:18.640
It's me.

33:21.120 --> 33:22.080
Are you off work yet?

33:22.920 --> 33:24.640
No. Just taking a break.

33:25.480 --> 33:26.880
I won't disturb you then.

33:33.200 --> 33:34.080
Have a drink.

33:37.160 --> 33:40.120
What are you doing here
this late at night?

33:40.200 --> 33:41.560
Isn't your family worried?

33:42.360 --> 33:43.600
They don't know I'm here.

33:44.080 --> 33:45.720
I couldn't sleep without seeing you.

33:51.640 --> 33:52.680
Soothing tea?

33:53.920 --> 33:55.000
You gave it to me before.

33:56.280 --> 33:57.240
Thanks.

33:57.320 --> 33:58.280
You're welcome.

34:11.320 --> 34:12.560
How are you holding up?

34:14.760 --> 34:15.600
I'm all right.

34:24.320 --> 34:25.880
If you need someone to talk to,

34:25.960 --> 34:27.040
I'm always available.

34:29.000 --> 34:29.880
Okay.

34:35.480 --> 34:36.400
You poor thing.

34:37.360 --> 34:38.800
It's not fatigue.

34:39.800 --> 34:40.880
But this time,

34:42.280 --> 34:44.320
something about it
just doesn't feel right.

34:45.480 --> 34:46.560
I get it.

34:46.639 --> 34:49.360
I'll plan something for Valentine's Day

34:49.440 --> 34:50.679
that will cheer you up.

34:50.760 --> 34:51.840
Sure.

36:07.080 --> 36:08.240
ZHUANG JIE

36:13.600 --> 36:14.440
Hello.

36:15.040 --> 36:16.360
Are you back at the apartment?

36:17.160 --> 36:18.040
Yes.

36:18.800 --> 36:20.240
What's with your voice?

36:20.320 --> 36:21.280
Were you sleeping?

36:23.360 --> 36:25.120
Yes, and I had a strange dream.

36:25.200 --> 36:26.200
But now I'm awake.

36:27.520 --> 36:29.200
You've had a rough week.

36:29.280 --> 36:30.720
Why don't you sleep in?

36:30.800 --> 36:31.720
No need.

36:32.240 --> 36:33.920
Today is a big day.

36:34.760 --> 36:36.360
I'm all set. Why don't you come over?

36:37.320 --> 36:38.960
Sure. Give me a minute.

36:39.040 --> 36:40.000
All right.

36:56.360 --> 36:59.840
PROVINCIAL HOSPITAL NEUROSURGERY

37:05.880 --> 37:06.720
Hello.

37:37.360 --> 37:38.600
Chen Maidong.

37:38.680 --> 37:40.760
How dare you not greet me at the door?

37:44.320 --> 37:45.720
Happy Valentine's Day.

37:46.840 --> 37:48.000
Happy Valentine's Day.

37:51.800 --> 37:53.760
This is our first Valentine's Day.

37:53.840 --> 37:55.320
It's a bit plain.

37:55.400 --> 37:57.640
Next year, I'll prepare something grander.

37:59.520 --> 38:00.920
Did you pick these wildflowers?

38:01.000 --> 38:03.080
Of course. Store-bought flowers
just aren't the same.

38:04.520 --> 38:05.440
I'm so touched.

38:06.480 --> 38:08.760
You're so easily pleased. Just you wait.

38:08.840 --> 38:11.160
I'll prepare a surprise
for you every year from now on.

38:34.000 --> 38:37.320
"Let's see who is better… "

38:42.680 --> 38:44.200
What a riot.

38:44.280 --> 38:45.720
She will love this one.

38:45.800 --> 38:47.000
I should write it down.

39:02.120 --> 39:04.640
You must be exhausted, aren't you?

39:07.440 --> 39:08.600
Ever since I moved back,

39:09.080 --> 39:11.080
I haven't faced such a big challenge.

39:18.480 --> 39:19.560
You guys

39:20.480 --> 39:22.600
are always serving the people.

39:26.360 --> 39:27.560
Let's not talk about work.

39:29.720 --> 39:31.120
I have a present for you too.

39:33.840 --> 39:36.560
You've been so busy lately.

39:36.640 --> 39:38.920
Why did you trouble yourself?

39:39.000 --> 39:40.320
It's not like I would mind.

39:40.960 --> 39:42.000
But I wanted to.

39:52.640 --> 39:53.760
Let me see.

39:54.800 --> 39:56.320
Open it at home.

39:56.400 --> 39:57.400
It's a bit crude.

40:03.400 --> 40:04.640
Why are you being so mysterious?

40:05.640 --> 40:07.360
As long as it's from you,

40:07.440 --> 40:08.280
I'll like it.

40:18.760 --> 40:19.640
What's the matter?

40:20.560 --> 40:21.440
I don't know.

40:22.960 --> 40:24.280
Before I met you,

40:25.440 --> 40:26.800
I was never so emotional.

40:28.680 --> 40:30.400
Sometimes, I was even glad

40:31.480 --> 40:32.720
that I didn't yearn for anything

40:33.680 --> 40:34.840
or fear anything.

40:36.600 --> 40:37.760
What about now?

40:38.640 --> 40:40.160
I'm afraid now.

40:41.760 --> 40:42.720
What are you afraid of?

40:45.760 --> 40:46.880
Afraid of dying alone.

40:54.920 --> 40:56.080
What's wrong?

40:58.840 --> 41:01.200
What happened? You're making me worry.

41:03.960 --> 41:05.600
I received a call from Ms. Lin's hospital.

41:07.520 --> 41:08.480
I must go.

41:12.640 --> 41:13.640
I'll come with you.

41:16.400 --> 41:18.200
Ms. Lin doesn't want anyone else to know.

41:19.880 --> 41:21.040
We should respect her wishes.

43:13.640 --> 43:14.840
What about now?

43:15.720 --> 43:17.120
I'm afraid now.

43:18.840 --> 43:19.760
What are you afraid of?

43:22.680 --> 43:24.000
Afraid of dying alone.

49:08.360 --> 49:14.960
ALL ANIMALS IN THIS PROGRAM
WERE TREATED KINDLY
